cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Multimodal Probe Design for Infant Neuroimaging
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Valls Santafé
    given-names: Silvia
repository-code: "https://github.com/silviiavalls/multimodal-infant-neuroimaging"
abstract: >-
  Computational design and geometric validation of head-mounted probes
  integrating EEG, fNIRS and fDCS for speech-processing research in
  4-5-month-old infants, together with a thread-actuated pressure mechanism
  designed to improve optode-scalp contact through hair.
keywords:
  - neuroimaging
  - fNIRS
  - fDCS
  - EEG
  - multimodal
  - infant language acquisition
  - probe design
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
